{"id":"ad67d470dcdc91b8","group":"29","path":"29/29-df-fo-ifp.md","title":"膨胀不动点逻辑 FO(IFP)","display":"df-fo-ifp — 膨胀不动点逻辑 FO(IFP)","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)","book_abbrev":"29","label":"29-df-fo-ifp","aliases":["29-df-fo-ifp"],"display":"df-fo-ifp — 膨胀不动点逻辑 FO(IFP)","depends_on":["[[29-df-structure]]","[[29-df-ifp]]","[[29-df-formula]]","[[29-df-term]]","[[29-df-variable]]","[[29-df-vocab]]","[[29-df-assignment]]","[[29-df-satisfaction]]","[[29-df-free-variable]]","[[29-df-term-interpretation]]"],"source_locator":"§9.1, pp.142–143, DjVu scans 157–158","source_basis":"用户提供的 DjVu 隐藏文本层；陈述已对照，证明核对范围见 Remark","revision_basis":"本次仅据用户提供的29(1).zip修订；既有原书定位及过往核对叙述为继承记录，未重新取得或查看DjVu原件","revision_verification":"数学类型与接口审查、静态结构及链接检查；未提交证明助理内核证书"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"29"},{"key":"label","html":"29-df-fo-ifp"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>29-df-fo-ifp</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-fo-ifp — 膨胀不动点逻辑 FO(IFP)"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0ac4b9a122d458e2\" href=\"?note=0ac4b9a122d458e2\" title=\"29-df-structure\">29-df-structure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a713bbaa5e1d7ea4\" href=\"?note=a713bbaa5e1d7ea4\" title=\"29-df-ifp\">29-df-ifp</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"a3fa1d78e657e6a2\" href=\"?note=a3fa1d78e657e6a2\" title=\"29-df-formula\">29-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"575d9a1532e3c73b\" href=\"?note=575d9a1532e3c73b\" title=\"29-df-term\">29-df-term</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"ad08b66c5e54a436\" href=\"?note=ad08b66c5e54a436\" title=\"29-df-variable\">29-df-variable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"28e86a5f0243a0ae\" href=\"?note=28e86a5f0243a0ae\" title=\"29-df-vocab\">29-df-vocab</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"ac5c4072279f0088\" href=\"?note=ac5c4072279f0088\" title=\"29-df-assignment\">29-df-assignment</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"3ee556c64b16809b\" href=\"?note=3ee556c64b16809b\" title=\"29-df-satisfaction\">29-df-satisfaction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"db2b32546860e623\" href=\"?note=db2b32546860e623\" title=\"29-df-free-variable\">29-df-free-variable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"76bbac386a4be5a3\" href=\"?note=76bbac386a4be5a3\" title=\"29-df-term-interpretation\">29-df-term-interpretation</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"§9.1, pp.142–143, DjVu scans 157–158"},{"key":"source_basis","html":"用户提供的 DjVu 隐藏文本层；陈述已对照，证明核对范围见 Remark"},{"key":"revision_basis","html":"本次仅据用户提供的29(1).zip修订；既有原书定位及过往核对叙述为继承记录，未重新取得或查看DjVu原件"},{"key":"revision_verification","html":"数学类型与接口审查、静态结构及链接检查；未提交证明助理内核证书"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau,\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Vocabulary}\">\\(\\tau,\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Vocabulary}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(j\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}_\\sigma,\\mathrm{Term}_\\sigma,\\mathrm{Var}\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}_\\sigma,\\mathrm{Term}_\\sigma,\\mathrm{Var}\\)</span> 见所列语法依赖。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>生成规则中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\geq1\">\\(k\\geq1\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R^{(k)}\\notin\\sigma\">\\(R^{(k)}\\notin\\sigma\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar x\\in\\mathrm{Var}^k\">\\(\\bar x\\in\\mathrm{Var}^k\\)</span> 各分量不同，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_\\sigma^k\">\\(\\bar t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_\\sigma^k\\)</span>；上述参数在集合构造中遍历所有合法取值。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]\">\\(A\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Assgn}(A)\">\\(\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Assgn}(A)\\)</span>。满足关系的 FO 子句沿用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"3ee556c64b16809b\" href=\"?note=3ee556c64b16809b\" title=\"29-df-satisfaction\">29-df-satisfaction</a>，算子子句按严格较小的公式体递归；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FV}\">\\(\\mathrm{FV}\\)</span> 沿用 FO 自由变量并由下式扩展。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{IFP}\">\\(\\operatorname{IFP}\\)</span> 的膨胀迭代见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"a713bbaa5e1d7ea4\" href=\"?note=a713bbaa5e1d7ea4\" title=\"29-df-ifp\">29-df-ifp</a>；下式用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IFP}\">\\(\\mathrm{IFP}\\)</span> 标记扩张语义。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>以下核心递归中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{AtFml}_{\\tau}\">\\(\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{AtFml}_{\\tau}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\phi,\\psi\">\\(\\phi,\\psi\\)</span> 属于本条扩张公式集，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\circ\\in\\{\\land,\\lor,\\to,\\leftrightarrow\\}\">\\(\\circ\\in\\{\\land,\\lor,\\to,\\leftrightarrow\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\\in\\{\\exists,\\forall\\}\">\\(Q\\in\\{\\exists,\\forall\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathrm{Var}\">\\(x\\in\\mathrm{Var}\\)</span>；不是把带扩张子式的公式直接交给纯FO的满足函数。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>算子子句中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\in\\mathsf R\\setminus\\operatorname{Sym}(\\tau)\">\\(R\\in\\mathsf R\\setminus\\operatorname{Sym}(\\tau)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ar}(R)=k\">\\(\\operatorname{ar}(R)=k\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar x\\in\\mathrm{Var}^k\">\\(\\bar x\\in\\mathrm{Var}^k\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|\\operatorname{rng}(\\bar x)|=k\">\\(|\\operatorname{rng}(\\bar x)|=k\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\phi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathrm{FO(IFP)}}[\\tau\\cup\\{R\\}]\">\\(\\phi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathrm{FO(IFP)}}[\\tau\\cup\\{R\\}]\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(i\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>。每个阶段的全部绑定参数保持不变。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal F^{0,\\mathrm{IFP}}_\\sigma\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Fml}_\\sigma.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal F^{0,\\mathrm{IFP}}_\\sigma\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Fml}_\\sigma.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal F^{j+1,\\mathrm{IFP}}_\\sigma\\coloneqq\\mathcal F^{j,\\mathrm{IFP}}_\\sigma\\cup\\{\\neg\\phi,\\phi\\circ\\psi,Qx\\,\\phi\\mid\\phi,\\psi\\in\\mathcal F^{j,\\mathrm{IFP}}_\\sigma,\\ x\\in\\mathrm{Var},\\ \\circ\\in\\{\\land,\\lor,\\to,\\leftrightarrow\\},\\ Q\\in\\{\\exists,\\forall\\}\\}\\cup\\{[\\operatorname{IFP}_{R,\\bar x}\\phi](\\bar t)\\mid\\phi\\in\\mathcal F^{j,\\mathrm{IFP}}_{\\sigma\\cup\\{R\\}}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal F^{j+1,\\mathrm{IFP}}_\\sigma\\coloneqq\\mathcal F^{j,\\mathrm{IFP}}_\\sigma\\cup\\{\\neg\\phi,\\phi\\circ\\psi,Qx\\,\\phi\\mid\\phi,\\psi\\in\\mathcal F^{j,\\mathrm{IFP}}_\\sigma,\\ x\\in\\mathrm{Var},\\ \\circ\\in\\{\\land,\\lor,\\to,\\leftrightarrow\\},\\ Q\\in\\{\\exists,\\forall\\}\\}\\cup\\{[\\operatorname{IFP}_{R,\\bar x}\\phi](\\bar t)\\mid\\phi\\in\\mathcal F^{j,\\mathrm{IFP}}_{\\sigma\\cup\\{R\\}}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathrm{FO(IFP)}}[\\tau]\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{j\\in\\mathbb N}\\mathcal F^{j,\\mathrm{IFP}}_\\tau,\\qquad\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{FO(IFP)}}[\\tau]\\coloneqq\\{\\phi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathrm{FO(IFP)}}[\\tau]\\mid\\mathrm{FV}(\\phi)=\\varnothing\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathrm{FO(IFP)}}[\\tau]\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{j\\in\\mathbb N}\\mathcal F^{j,\\mathrm{IFP}}_\\tau,\\qquad\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{FO(IFP)}}[\\tau]\\coloneqq\\{\\phi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathrm{FO(IFP)}}[\\tau]\\mid\\mathrm{FV}(\\phi)=\\varnothing\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"F^{\\mathrm{IFP}}_{A,\\beta,R,\\bar x,\\phi}(X)\\coloneqq\\{\\bar a\\in|A|^k\\mid A[R:=X]\\models_{\\mathrm{IFP}}\\phi[\\beta[\\bar a/\\bar x]]\\},\\qquad X\\subseteq|A|^k.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[F^{\\mathrm{IFP}}_{A,\\beta,R,\\bar x,\\phi}(X)\\coloneqq\\{\\bar a\\in|A|^k\\mid A[R:=X]\\models_{\\mathrm{IFP}}\\phi[\\beta[\\bar a/\\bar x]]\\},\\qquad X\\subseteq|A|^k.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"X_0^{A,\\beta,R,\\bar x,\\phi,\\mathrm{IFP}}\\coloneqq\\varnothing,\\qquad X_{i+1}^{A,\\beta,R,\\bar x,\\phi,\\mathrm{IFP}}\\coloneqq X_i^{A,\\beta,R,\\bar x,\\phi,\\mathrm{IFP}}\\cup F^{\\mathrm{IFP}}_{A,\\beta,R,\\bar x,\\phi}(X_i^{A,\\beta,R,\\bar x,\\phi,\\mathrm{IFP}}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[X_0^{A,\\beta,R,\\bar x,\\phi,\\mathrm{IFP}}\\coloneqq\\varnothing,\\qquad X_{i+1}^{A,\\beta,R,\\bar x,\\phi,\\mathrm{IFP}}\\coloneqq X_i^{A,\\beta,R,\\bar x,\\phi,\\mathrm{IFP}}\\cup F^{\\mathrm{IFP}}_{A,\\beta,R,\\bar x,\\phi}(X_i^{A,\\beta,R,\\bar x,\\phi,\\mathrm{IFP}}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A\\models_{\\mathrm{IFP}}[\\operatorname{IFP}_{R,\\bar x}\\phi](\\bar t)[\\beta]\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\bar t^A[\\beta]\\in\\bigcup_{i\\in\\mathbb N}X_i^{A,\\beta,R,\\bar x,\\phi,\\mathrm{IFP}}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A\\models_{\\mathrm{IFP}}[\\operatorname{IFP}_{R,\\bar x}\\phi](\\bar t)[\\beta]\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\bar t^A[\\beta]\\in\\bigcup_{i\\in\\mathbb N}X_i^{A,\\beta,R,\\bar x,\\phi,\\mathrm{IFP}}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FV}([\\operatorname{IFP}_{R,\\bar x}\\phi](\\bar t))\\coloneqq(\\mathrm{FV}(\\phi)\\setminus\\operatorname{rng}(\\bar x))\\cup\\mathrm{FV}(\\bar t).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{FV}([\\operatorname{IFP}_{R,\\bar x}\\phi](\\bar t))\\coloneqq(\\mathrm{FV}(\\phi)\\setminus\\operatorname{rng}(\\bar x))\\cup\\mathrm{FV}(\\bar t).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FV}(\\alpha)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FV}_{\\tau}(\\alpha),\\quad\\mathrm{FV}(\\neg\\phi)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FV}(\\phi),\\quad\\mathrm{FV}(\\phi\\circ\\psi)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FV}(\\phi)\\cup\\mathrm{FV}(\\psi),\\quad\\mathrm{FV}(Qx\\,\\phi)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FV}(\\phi)\\setminus\\{x\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{FV}(\\alpha)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FV}_{\\tau}(\\alpha),\\quad\\mathrm{FV}(\\neg\\phi)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FV}(\\phi),\\quad\\mathrm{FV}(\\phi\\circ\\psi)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FV}(\\phi)\\cup\\mathrm{FV}(\\psi),\\quad\\mathrm{FV}(Qx\\,\\phi)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FV}(\\phi)\\setminus\\{x\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A\\models_{\\mathrm{IFP}}\\alpha[\\beta]\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ A\\models\\alpha[\\beta],\\qquad A\\models_{\\mathrm{IFP}}(\\neg\\phi)[\\beta]\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\neg(A\\models_{\\mathrm{IFP}}\\phi[\\beta]).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A\\models_{\\mathrm{IFP}}\\alpha[\\beta]\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ A\\models\\alpha[\\beta],\\qquad A\\models_{\\mathrm{IFP}}(\\neg\\phi)[\\beta]\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\neg(A\\models_{\\mathrm{IFP}}\\phi[\\beta]).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A\\models_{\\mathrm{IFP}}(\\phi\\land\\psi)[\\beta]\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ (A\\models_{\\mathrm{IFP}}\\phi[\\beta]\\land A\\models_{\\mathrm{IFP}}\\psi[\\beta]),\\qquad A\\models_{\\mathrm{IFP}}(\\phi\\lor\\psi)[\\beta]\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ (A\\models_{\\mathrm{IFP}}\\phi[\\beta]\\lor A\\models_{\\mathrm{IFP}}\\psi[\\beta]).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A\\models_{\\mathrm{IFP}}(\\phi\\land\\psi)[\\beta]\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ (A\\models_{\\mathrm{IFP}}\\phi[\\beta]\\land A\\models_{\\mathrm{IFP}}\\psi[\\beta]),\\qquad A\\models_{\\mathrm{IFP}}(\\phi\\lor\\psi)[\\beta]\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ (A\\models_{\\mathrm{IFP}}\\phi[\\beta]\\lor A\\models_{\\mathrm{IFP}}\\psi[\\beta]).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A\\models_{\\mathrm{IFP}}(\\phi\\to\\psi)[\\beta]\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ (A\\models_{\\mathrm{IFP}}\\phi[\\beta]\\to A\\models_{\\mathrm{IFP}}\\psi[\\beta]),\\qquad A\\models_{\\mathrm{IFP}}(\\phi\\leftrightarrow\\psi)[\\beta]\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ ((A\\models_{\\mathrm{IFP}}\\phi[\\beta])\\leftrightarrow(A\\models_{\\mathrm{IFP}}\\psi[\\beta])).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A\\models_{\\mathrm{IFP}}(\\phi\\to\\psi)[\\beta]\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ (A\\models_{\\mathrm{IFP}}\\phi[\\beta]\\to A\\models_{\\mathrm{IFP}}\\psi[\\beta]),\\qquad A\\models_{\\mathrm{IFP}}(\\phi\\leftrightarrow\\psi)[\\beta]\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ ((A\\models_{\\mathrm{IFP}}\\phi[\\beta])\\leftrightarrow(A\\models_{\\mathrm{IFP}}\\psi[\\beta])).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A\\models_{\\mathrm{IFP}}(\\exists x\\,\\phi)[\\beta]\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists a\\in|A|\\;A\\models_{\\mathrm{IFP}}\\phi[\\beta[a/x]],\\qquad A\\models_{\\mathrm{IFP}}(\\forall x\\,\\phi)[\\beta]\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\forall a\\in|A|\\;A\\models_{\\mathrm{IFP}}\\phi[\\beta[a/x]].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A\\models_{\\mathrm{IFP}}(\\exists x\\,\\phi)[\\beta]\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists a\\in|A|\\;A\\models_{\\mathrm{IFP}}\\phi[\\beta[a/x]],\\qquad A\\models_{\\mathrm{IFP}}(\\forall x\\,\\phi)[\\beta]\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\forall a\\in|A|\\;A\\models_{\\mathrm{IFP}}\\phi[\\beta[a/x]].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A\\models_{\\mathrm{IFP}}\\phi\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\forall\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Assgn}(A)\\;A\\models_{\\mathrm{IFP}}\\phi[\\beta],\\qquad\\mathrm{FV}(\\phi)=\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A\\models_{\\mathrm{IFP}}\\phi\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\forall\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Assgn}(A)\\;A\\models_{\\mathrm{IFP}}\\phi[\\beta],\\qquad\\mathrm{FV}(\\phi)=\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 §9.1，印刷页 142–143，扫描页 157–158。IFP 不要求定义体正性；每次加入旧关系使链递增。语法和满足关系均由有限公式树递归给出。</p>\n<p>本次来源边界：以上原书定位与过往核对叙述继承自所给文件，不表示本次重新查看了原书或完成机器证明；本次修补以现有文本